  moveName: Reflect
  description: "Protect an aimed ally, or yourself if no ally is selected, reducing physical damage by 35% for 4 seconds. Stores 35% of physical damage received after mitigation, including damage absorbed by shields (up to 2500). On expiry or the recipient's KO, the protection detonates in a 4m radius for the stored amount as true damage. Use again to detonate early; this ends the protection without restarting its cooldown. Upgrade: raises the stored-damage cap to 3000."
